              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Added Health: 0 -> 250"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kinetic Cuirass",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Attacks needed to trigger: 5 -> 4"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Can now store up to two charges of Kinetic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Tekko-Kagi",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Pathfinding Duration: 10s -> 8s"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Strength: 50 -> 45"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Attack Speed: 25% -> 20%"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Gem of Focus",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Intelligence: 75 -> 65"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Pathfinding Duration: 10s -> 8s"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The Cosmic Horror",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Intelligence: 85 -> 75"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Bug Fixes",
      "anchor": "Bug_Fixes",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Fixed Curios and Role Passives being removed in Conquest Vs AI"
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed Artemis traps showing enemy coloration on the minimap for friendlies"
            },
            {
              "text": "Morgan Le Fay’s Sigil Mastery (A01) has been completely rewritten technically. Cast mode issues and “clunkiness” for players with bad connections should be resolved."
            },
            {
              "text": "Degree of Misconduct notifications have been updated with new icons."
            },
            {
              "text": "Friendly Artemis traps will no longer show as red dots on the minimap"
            },
            {
              "text": "Conquest vs. AI will no longer remove Role Buffs or Curios"
            },
            {
              "text": "Filters/Respawning will no longer refocus the Item Store cursor to the top of the store"
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed an issue that could lead to Hyper Speed/Stuck Movements."
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed an issue where Ne Zha’s slow would bypass slow immunities."
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed an issue where old items that received new stats were not showing up on the Split store (Console store) under the Special tab."
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed an issue where Console could not scroll God Abilities on the Gods tab."
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed a player-reported Chiron A01 size issue (it was too small by .3m)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Hotfix 4/8/26",
      "anchor": "Hotfix_4/8/26",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Gameplay",
          "anchor": "Gameplay_2",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Abilities that can critical strike now only do 50% item proc damage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Item Adjustments",
          "anchor": "Item_Adjustments",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bumba's Golden Dagger",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "On attack hit: 15% bonus Physical Damage ->10% bonus physical damage"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mercury's Talaria",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Passive: your next non-Ultimate ability deals up to 20% more damage -> 8% more damage. If this was a movement ability deals 10% more damage instead."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Hotfix 4/11/26",
      "anchor": "Hotfix_4/11/26",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Item Balance Updates",
      "anchor": "Item_Balance_Updates",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Bumba’s Golden Dagger, Bumba’s Spear, and Golden Blade"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We are addressing unintended interactions where area-of-effect abilities and attacks could trigger multiple item procs. These items will now only proc once on each target per activation. This will lead to a drastic reduction in unintended bonus burst damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Bumba’s Cudgelntly too plentiful and can be abused by certain Gods, leading to unhealthy play patterns."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Hit this Attack:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Cooldown reduction decreased from 0.75s to 0.33s."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Bumba’s Hammer"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Hit this Attack:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Cooldown reduction decreased from 1.0s to 0.66s."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Developer Note on Cooldown Items: You may notice Pendulum Blade and Staff of Myrddin are missing from this list. The specific adjustments we want to make to these items cannot be done via a server-side hotfix. However, we are taking a hard look at all sources of free flat Cooldown Reduction for future updates."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Wyrmskin Hide"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We are pivoting this item's identity to focus more on Max Health and Dampening, removing its overly strong early-game spikes."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Strength:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Decreased from 40 to 20."
            },
            {
              "text": "Max Health:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Increased from 250 to 300."
            },
            {
              "text": "Dampening:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Decreased from 15 to 10."
            },
            {
              "text": "Passive Dampening:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Changed from 20 flat to 1 Dampening per Level."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Shield Splitter"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We are shifting this item to function more as a damage-heavy, anti-shield hybrid tool."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Physical Protections:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Decreased from 30 to 15."
            },
            {
              "text": "Magical Protections:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Decreased from 30 to 15."
            },
            {
              "text": "Shield Removed:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Increased from 65% to 70%."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "God & Aspect Balance Updates",
      "anchor": "God_&amp;_Aspect_Balance_Updates",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Apollo Aspect"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Triple \"So Beautiful\" provides an extremely strong source of poke. We are reducing its damage for now and will likely revisit this in a future update."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "So Beautiful (Ability 1):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Damage reduced from 60/100/140/180/220 to 40/80/120/160/200."
            },
            {
              "text": "So Beautiful (Ability 1):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "no longer applies the Attack Speed Buff to Apollo"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Da Ji (Base and Aspect)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Da Ji has remained a top pick in both forms, largely due to the sheer power concentrated in her second ability. We are reducing this damage and are keeping a close eye on her Paolao immunity time for a future patch."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "One-Thousand Cuts (Ability 2) Aspect:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Damage scaling reduced from 75% Strength + 15% Intelligence + 75% Attack Damage to 60% Strength + 12% Intelligence + 60% Attack Damage."
            },
            {
              "text": "One-Thousand Cuts (Ability 2) Non-Aspect:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Base Damage reduced from 35/50/65/80/95 to 30/42/54/66/78."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Fenrir"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The release of Echo highlighted the extreme strength of Brutalize. While the bug fixes to the Bumba’s tree and Golden Blade will naturally address his worst-case scenarios, we are giving him a light adjustment here as well."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Brutalize (Ability 3)",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Strength Scaling reduced from 45% to 40%."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Empowered Strength Scaling reduced from 60% to 55%."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Hercules"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Hercules has been frustrating at higher ranks. This change is intended to slightly check his early game while we monitor how the broader item adjustments impact his win rate."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Driving Strike (Ability 1):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Cooldown increased from 13s flat to 15/14.5/14/13.5/13s."
            },
            {
              "text": "Earthbreaker (Ability 2):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Cooldown increased from 13s flat to 15/14.5/14/13.5/13s."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Kali Aspect"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Kali Aspect has been overperforming by abusing on-hit procs with her 1/0.5/0.5 attack chain. This is overly potent for a ranged Carry who also gains piercing attacks during her ultimate."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Basic Attacks:",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Attacks now process items at 66% Efficiency."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Ne Zha Aspect"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "This Aspect currently provides too much tankiness without sacrificing damage. We are refocusing its identity heavily onto sustain and reducing its lethal output accordingly."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Flaming Spear (Ability 2):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Enflamed Max Health Damage reduced from [6% of Base Health + 3-5% Item Health] to [4% of Base Health + 1.5-3.5% Item Health]."
            },
            {
              "text": "Wind Fire Wheels (Ultimate):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "No longer deals % Health Damage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Nu Wa Aspect"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "This Aspect was simply functioning as a strictly better version of Nu Wa. We are shifting its focus to Attacking and may revisit her identity further in a future patch."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Shining Metal (Ability 3):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Base Damage, Strength, and Intelligence Scalings have been removed. This ability now deals 200% of Basic Attack Damage (cannot Crit)."
            },
            {
              "text": "Fire Shards (Ultimate):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Attack Damage Scaling reduced from 70% to 60%."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Odin"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Canceling Gungnir’s Might early was allowing players to deal more burst damage than intended due to the massive cooldown refund."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Gungnir’s Might (Ability 3):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Early refire cooldown reduction decreased from 40% to 20%."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Merlin"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Merlin is too safe and effective in the early game considering his massive late-game prowess. He is also spamming abilities too quickly by abusing the Cooldown Reduction on his Flicker."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Flicker | Ice (Ability 3):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Ability Cooldown Reduction decreased from 5s to 2s."
            },
            {
              "text": "Elemental Mastery (Ultimate):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Cooldown increased from 30/27.5/25/22.5/20s to 40/35/30/25/20s."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Pele Aspect"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Pele Aspect gained incredible survivability but didn't give up enough burst damage to justify it."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Pyroclast (Ability 1):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Initial Damage Scaling reduced from 60% Strength to 50% Strength."
            },
            {
              "text": "Volcanic Lightning (Ultimate):",
              "bold": true,
              "detail": "Initial Dash Hit Damage reduced from 180/255/330/405/480 to 160/235/310/385/460."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Developer Note on Ratatoskr: We hear your feedback that Ratatoskr's base kit feels underpowered and underwhelming. We could have shipped a quick numbers buff in this hotfix, but we want to do it right. We are actively working on exactly how to address his core issues for a future update."
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    }
  ]
}